# Dietary System ERD

This entity-relationship diagram reflects the schema created or consumed by the PHP application. It is written in Mermaid, so it renders directly in VS Code, GitHub, and Mermaid-compatible Markdown viewers.

## System Overview

The overview separates the three main workflows before the detailed table view.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph PLANNING[People and meal planning]
        USERS[Users]
        PATIENTS[Patients]
        CYCLES[Meal cycles]
        PLANS[Meal plans]
    end

    subgraph OPERATIONS[Inventory and kitchen operations]
        INVENTORY[Inventory]
        STOCK[Stock logs]
        REQS[Requisitions]
        RETURNS[Ingredient returns]
        WASTE[Waste logs]
    end

    subgraph PROCUREMENT[Procurement and oversight]
        SUPPLIERS[Suppliers]
        PURCHASES[Purchase requests]
        ALERTS[Notifications]
        AUDIT[Activity and edit logs]
    end

    USERS --> CYCLES
    CYCLES --> PLANS
    PATIENTS --> PLANS
    PLANS --> REQS
    REQS --> STOCK
    INVENTORY --> STOCK
    REQS --> RETURNS
    INVENTORY --> WASTE
    SUPPLIERS --> PURCHASES
    PURCHASES --> INVENTORY
    USERS --> ALERTS
    USERS --> AUDIT
```

